Package: whyna
Title: Informative Missingness via vctrs Records
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Andrew", "Brown", , "brown.andrewg@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment=c(ORCID="0000-0002-4565-533X"))
Description: Implements typed/informative missingness following Rubin's MCAR/MAR/MNAR framework.
    Tracks why values are missing using a vctrs record vector with 'value' and 'type' fields.
    Integrates cleanly with tibble, dplyr, and base R idioms.
